  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRC RRM 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRK RRM 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RRM is an important tool for responding to disaster. It allows SRC and the RC/RC Movement to have a flexible and rapid response to emergencies worldwide. In 2011 SRC was granted for SEK 42.1 million for Minor Emergencies frame,including administrative costs.Through the RRM, SRC aims to indirectly reach millions of people affected by suddenonset humanitarian crises in 2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RRM &#xe4;r ett viktigt verktyg f&#xf6;r att bem&#xf6;ta katastrofer. Den ger SRK och RK / RH r&#xf6;relsen att ha en flexibel och snabbt reagera p&#xe5; n&#xf6;dsituationer &#xf6;ver hela v&#xe4;rlden. Under 2011 beviljades SRK 42,1 Mkr f&#xf6;r Sm&#xe4;rre humanit&#xe4;ra kriserr, inbegripet administrativa kostnader. Genom mekanismen syftar SRK till att indirekt n&#xe5; miljontals m&#xe4;nniskor som drabbats av pl&#xf6;tsliga humanit&#xe4;ra kriser under 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
